+/*
+ * 0013 "passlog": boot-arg sweetmetal_passlog=1 makes each process say, at most once per five
+ * seconds, which fragment functions its draws went to and what the command buffers holding
+ * them cost from the start of -commit's replay to the end of its wait (CPU wall clock, the
+ * library's lock held, so it is submit-to-done as this process sees it, not the GPU's own
+ * time). Diagnostics only: nothing drawn changes. Absent, rw_passlog_on() is the only work.
